# Defaults to the deployed Railway backend, including /api.
# Production override: copy this file to .env.local and uncomment the value.
# Development uses Vite's Railway proxy and ignores this variable.
# VITE_API_URL=https://smart-campus-event-management-production-1133.up.railway.app/api
# For a local backend, change the proxy target in vite.config.ts instead.
